<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 6.423 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 6.423 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 6.423 billion pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said, adding they had no further details for the moment.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
